!\OXIDSPEC: 
!---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
!\SUBMECH: \CH3OCHO 
!Minwegen, H.; D   ntgen, M.; Hemken, C.; B   ttgen, R.; Leonhard, K. & Heufer, K. A. Experimental and theoretical investigation of methyl formate oxidation including hot beta-scission Proc. Combust. Inst., 2019
!---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
!\OXIDSPEC:
QCH2OCOOOH				! OOH at formate group, radical at methyl group	[CH2]OC(=O)OO	C2H3O4	QOOH
OOHCH2OCOQ				! OOH at methyl group, radical at formate group	OOCO[C]=O	C2H3O4	QOOH
O2CH3OCO				! O2 addition at formate group	COC(=O)O[O]	C2H3O4	RO2
O2CH2OCHO				! O2 addition at methyl group	[O]OCOC=O	C2H3O4	RO2
CYCH2OCO2				! 1,3-dioxetan-2-one	O=C1OCO1	C2H2O3	dioxetane
OCHOCHO					! formic anhydride, formyl formate	O=COC=O	C2H2O3	organic acid anhydride
!---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
